{"version":1,"content":"<p>近年來，隨着Windows 11不斷調整系統功能和硬件要求，尋找Windows替代方案的用户越來越多。不過，現有替代系統大多以Linux發行版為主，真正嘗試從零開始開發一套全新桌面作業系統的項目並不多見。近日，一個名為Impossible OS的開源項目引起了關注，其開發者希望打造一款既不基於Linux，也不依賴Windows代碼，卻能夠原生運行Windows應用程式的全新作業系統。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587008.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:54:53.085399+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:33:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:11.702300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:11.702300+00:00","content_hash":"13f6236796c7292fc8c677b5e60ce2d570e212ad7a8d1240c1222033131b68ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}